+config RYZEN_SMU
+	tristate "AMD Ryzen SMU command interface"
+	depends on X86 && PCI
+	help
+	  Exposes the AMD System Management Unit (SMU) mailbox for Ryzen
+	  processors through sysfs files under /sys/kernel/ryzen_smu_drv/.
